      "message": "since we can rely on this class to check that out of range values result in INVALID (which we can enforce with a swanky unit test), we don\u0027t need to check to be sure that the value is \u003e MIN_LTE_RSRP... if we aren\u0027t moderate, and we aren\u0027t UNKNOWN, then we NONE_UNKNOWN by default.",
